    "markingSchemeEn": "(a) The data are already in order and there are 12 values, so the median is the mean of the 6th and 7th values …… 1 mark\n    $\\dfrac{43+47}{2}=45$ …… 1 mark\n(b) The value occurring most often is $47$ (three times), so the mode is $47$ …… 1 mark\n    Range $=58-32=26$ …… 1 mark\n(c) The lower quartile $Q_{1}$ is the median of the first 6 values $=\\dfrac{35+38}{2}=36.5$ …… 1 mark\n    The upper quartile $Q_{3}$ is the median of the last 6 values $=\\dfrac{47+52}{2}=49.5$\n    Inter-quartile range $=49.5-36.5=13$ …… 1 mark",
    "suggestedMinutes": 7
