    "content": "〔卷一・乙部〕（7 分）\n\n一個長方體 $ABCDEFGH$ 中，底面為長方形 $ABCD$，$AB=12\\text{ cm}$，$BC=5\\text{ cm}$，而高 $=8\\text{ cm}$（$E$、$F$、$G$、$H$ 分別在 $A$、$B$、$C$、$D$ 的正上方）。\n(a) 求對角線 $AC$ 的長度。（2 分）\n(b) 求空間對角線 $AG$ 的長度，答案準確至三位有效數字。（2 分）\n(c) 求 $AG$ 與底面 $ABCD$ 所成的角，答案準確至三位有效數字。（3 分）",
    "explanation": "三維三角的整個技巧，就是把立體問題化為【兩個相繼的平面直角三角形】。本題先在底面用一次勾股定理求 $AC$，再在垂直平面 $ACG$ 用第二次求 $AG$。(c) 的關鍵在於認清「線與面所成的角」的定義：該線與它在該面上的【投影】所成的角。$AG$ 在底面的投影是 $AC$，所以角是 $\\angle GAC$，而不是 $\\angle GAB$ 或 $\\angle AGC$。作答前先在圖上畫出投影線，可避免取錯角。",
    "referenceAnswer": "(a) $AC=13\\text{ cm}$\n(b) $AG=\\sqrt{233}\\approx 15.3\\text{ cm}$\n(c) 約 $31.6^{\\circ}$",
    "marks": 7,
    "referenceAnswerEn": "(a) $AC=13\\text{ cm}$\n(b) $AG=\\sqrt{233}\\approx 15.3\\text{ cm}$\n(c) About $31.6^{\\circ}$",
    "contentEn": "[Paper 1 · Section B] (7 marks)\n\nIn a cuboid $ABCDEFGH$, the base $ABCD$ is a rectangle with $AB=12\\text{ cm}$ and $BC=5\\text{ cm}$, and the height is $8\\text{ cm}$ ($E$, $F$, $G$ and $H$ are vertically above $A$, $B$, $C$ and $D$ respectively).\n(a) Find the length of the diagonal $AC$. (2 marks)\n(b) Find the length of the space diagonal $AG$, correct to 3 significant figures. (2 marks)\n(c) Find the angle between $AG$ and the base $ABCD$, correct to 3 significant figures. (3 marks)",
    "explanationEn": "The whole technique of three-dimensional trigonometry is to reduce a solid problem to two successive plane right-angled triangles. Here Pythagoras' theorem is applied once in the base to find $AC$, and a second time in the vertical plane $ACG$ to find $AG$. The key to (c) is the definition of the angle between a line and a plane: it is the angle between the line and its projection on that plane. The projection of $AG$ on the base is $AC$, so the angle is $\\angle GAC$ and not $\\angle GAB$ or $\\angle AGC$. Drawing the projection on the diagram before answering prevents the wrong angle being taken.",
    "markingScheme": "(a) 在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中（$\\angle ABC=90^{\\circ}$）：$AC=\\sqrt{12^{2}+5^{2}}$ …… 1 分\n　　$=\\sqrt{169}=13\\text{ cm}$ …… 1 分\n(b) $CG$ 垂直於底面，故 $\\angle ACG=90^{\\circ}$：$AG=\\sqrt{AC^{2}+CG^{2}}=\\sqrt{13^{2}+8^{2}}$ …… 1 分\n　　$=\\sqrt{233}\\approx 15.3\\text{ cm}$ …… 1 分\n(c) $AC$ 為 $AG$ 在底面上的投影，故所求角為 $\\angle GAC$ …… 1 分\n　　$\\tan\\angle GAC=\\dfrac{CG}{AC}=\\dfrac{8}{13}$ …… 1 分\n　　$\\angle GAC\\approx 31.6^{\\circ}$ …… 1 分",
    "markingSchemeEn": "(a) In $\\triangle ABC$ (where $\\angle ABC=90^{\\circ}$): $AC=\\sqrt{12^{2}+5^{2}}$ …… 1 mark\n    $=\\sqrt{169}=13\\text{ cm}$ …… 1 mark\n(b) $CG$ is perpendicular to the base, so $\\angle ACG=90^{\\circ}$: $AG=\\sqrt{AC^{2}+CG^{2}}=\\sqrt{13^{2}+8^{2}}$ …… 1 mark\n    $=\\sqrt{233}\\approx 15.3\\text{ cm}$ …… 1 mark\n(c) $AC$ is the projection of $AG$ on the base, so the required angle is $\\angle GAC$ …… 1 mark\n    $\\tan\\angle GAC=\\dfrac{CG}{AC}=\\dfrac{8}{13}$ …… 1 mark\n    $\\angle GAC\\approx 31.6^{\\circ}$ …… 1 mark",
